  "properties": {
    "title": "Redmine Geo-Task-Tracker (GTT) Plugin",
    "description": "Redmine Geo-Task-Tracker (GTT) Plugin provides geospatial support for Redmine. Redmine is a well-known OSS issue management system. GTT Plugin enables to attach geospatial information(Point, Polyline and Polygon) to each issues. It is effective in management many issues based on geospatial infromation(ex. Road and park management). This talk introduces features and some use cases.",
